OL,3,GNEWSAJohn Swinney faces grilling on
OL,4,AScotland's drug deaths surge
OL,5,
OL,6,FNew Scottish Labour Party leader
OL,7,FMichael Marrra says the 11% rise in
OL,8,Fdrug deaths, revealed yesterday, shows
OL,9,Fthe Scottish government's "complacent
OL,10,Fdisgrace" over the "emergency" issue
OL,12,FFirst Minister John Swinney says his
OL,13,Fgovernment is working on tackling the
OL,14,Fscourge of drugs which has been
OL,15,Fexacerbated by inter-generational
OL,16,Ftrauma and poverty and an increase in
OL,17,Fsynthetic substances
OL,19,FReform UK Scotland's leader Malcolm
OL,20,FOfford also raises the annual drug
OL,21,Fdeaths as well as the government's
OL,22,Frecord on poverty
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
